sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant P as provision.sh
    participant L as libvirt/QEMU
    participant W as Windows Setup
    participant T as setup-tools.ps1
    U->>P: ./provision.sh
    P->>P: check ISOs, tools, /dev/kvm
    P->>P: render autounattend.xml, ssh key
    P->>P: xorriso config.iso, qemu-img disk
    P->>L: virt-install (define + start)
    P->>L: send-key SPACE x20
    L->>W: boot Windows ISO
    W->>W: read autounattend.xml, load virtio, partition, install
    W->>W: reboots, autologon
    W->>T: FirstLogonCommands
    T->>T: virtio tools, OpenSSH, RDP, winget, rust
    T-->>U: C:\setup-tools.done
    U->>L: ./vm.sh ssh
